Privacy Policy

Last updated: 11/20/2025

This Privacy Policy explains how the [Your App Name] (“the App”) handles user data.

1. Information We Collect

The App may collect the following information:

Location data (only when the user chooses to log work or record a session).

Work logs such as date, time, and entered amounts.

No other personal information is collected.

2. How We Use the Information

Collected information is used only for:

Displaying work logs inside the app.

Calculating totals and showing history.

3. Data Storage

All data is stored locally on the user’s device.
We do not send your information to any server.

4. Third-Party Services

The App does use Google Maps third-party services that collect user data.


5. Security

Since data is only stored locally on the device, it remains private unless the user shares their device.

6. Children’s Privacy

The App does not target children under 13.

7. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Policy from time to time. Users will be notified inside the app when changes occur.

8. Contact

If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact: rezakhanahmadi342@gmail.com
